units lj
atom_style angle
boundary p p p

lattice fcc 0.8
region box block 0 8 0 8 0 8
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box

mass 1 1.0

pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5

velocity all create 1.0 12345 dist gaussian

compute T_tr all temp

thermo_style custom step temp c_T_tr ke
thermo 100

fix fnve  all nve
fix flang all langevin 1.0 1.0 1.0 12345

run 2000
